  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Rinse the cod fish and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "Shave the bonito flakes over the cod fish.",
    "Drizzle the coconut milk and lime juice over the fish.",
    "Wrap each piece of fish in a lotus leaf.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the lotus leaves.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Place the wraps on a baking sheet and bake for 12 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
